I found the cause of the long search: selecting only `SPEC.next-smallest` filters out the separate loop claim, so the prover unrolls the loop instead of using its circularity. I stopped that diagnostic run cleanly; the required proof command will load and prove both claims together so the entry theorem can use the loop invariant.
