The validation artifacts are in place. The false-postcondition probe reaches concrete result `2` while demanding `None`, and the body-mutant probe reaches `None` while demanding `2`; both exit nonzero with `WarnStuckClaimState`. I’m running the finalized `prove.sh` end to end now so `PROOF.md` can quote one reproducible final run.
